1)\">修改配置文件</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ucca58c62\" id=\"ucca58c62\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">：用文本编辑器打开配置文件：</span></p><ol list=\"u5e5bff35\"><li fid=\"ufe79ed78\" data-lake-id=\"ue747edf0\" id=\"ue747edf0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4216963b\" id=\"u4216963b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">gedit ~/.config/user-dirs.dirs</span></li><li fid=\"ufe79ed78\" data-lake-id=\"ua0e78c01\" id=\"ua0e78c01\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufa079c45\" id=\"ufa079c45\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">编辑配置内容</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"udeb3aa74\" id=\"udeb3aa74\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">：将文件里所有的中文路径，替换成你想要的英文名。比如：</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%89%8D%5CnXDG_DOWNLOAD_DIR%3D%5C%22%24HOME%2F%E4%B8%8B%E8%BD%BD%5C%22%5Cn%23%20%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%90%8E%5CnXDG_DOWNLOAD_DIR%3D%5C%22%24HOME%2FDownloads%5C%22%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22id%22%3A%22vRGDK%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u09490e90\" id=\"u09490e90\"><span data-lake-id=\"u60248d5e\" id=\"u60248d5e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">其他目录的对照表如下，可根据自己喜好修改：</span></p><ul list=\"u3c079834\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u71bc0145\" data-lake-id=\"u4c3c34a4\" id=\"u4c3c34a4\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucc12f784\" id=\"ucc12f784\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">桌面 → </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2c03d8f4\" id=\"u2c03d8f4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">Desktop</span></strong></li><li fid=\"u71bc0145\" data-lake-id=\"u577fd39f\" id=\"u577fd39f\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc8274df9\" id=\"uc8274df9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">文档 → </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1d3b0acb\" id=\"u1d3b0acb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">Documents</span></strong></li><li fid=\"u71bc0145\" data-lake-id=\"ud7e9b1e4\" id=\"ud7e9b1e4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u043ce0f2\" id=\"u043ce0f2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">下载 → </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u60a1480e\" id=\"u60a1480e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">Downloads</span></strong></li><li fid=\"u71bc0145\" data-lake-id=\"ub4cc8b4a\" id=\"ub4cc8b4a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u40a281f3\" id=\"u40a281f3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">音乐 → </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u28260a73\" id=\"u28260a73\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">Music</span></strong></li><li fid=\"u71bc0145\" data-lake-id=\"u34757eff\" id=\"u34757eff\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8293a3e8\" id=\"u8293a3e8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">图片 → </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub1dfdd71\" id=\"ub1dfdd71\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">Pictures</span></strong></li><li fid=\"u71bc0145\" data-lake-id=\"u5d781a51\" id=\"u5d781a51\"><span data-lake-id=\"u45b3302c\" id=\"u45b3302c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">视频 → </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u647acc28\" id=\"u647acc28\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">Videos</span></strong></li><li fid=\"u71bc0145\" data-lake-id=\"ub78f3198\" id=\"ub78f3198\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua0c13707\" id=\"ua0c13707\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">模板 → </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uff321cf3\" id=\"uff321cf3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">Templates</span></strong></li><li fid=\"u71bc0145\" data-lake-id=\"u00c0db14\" id=\"u00c0db14\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud5894c2e\" id=\"ud5894c2e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">公共 → </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u73021431\" id=\"u73021431\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">Public</span></strong></li></ul><ol list=\"u5e5bff35\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"ufe79ed78\" data-lake-id=\"u266d3d85\" id=\"u266d3d85\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5590ac54\" id=\"u5590ac54\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">重命名实际文件夹</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud606c86b\" id=\"ud606c86b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">：光改配置不行，还得让实际文件夹的名字和配置对上。这一步需要用到 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u112604be\" id=\"u112604be\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2d06fa04\" id=\"u2d06fa04\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(243, 244, 244)\">mv</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u94d95d97\" id=\"u94d95d97\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\"> 命令，</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6b9c8368\" id=\"u6b9c8368\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">请务必确保路径与你配置文件中的设置一致</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5591e1fb\" id=\"u5591e1fb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u950d7da7\" id=\"u950d7da7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0d842535\" id=\"u0d842535\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">​</span><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E4%BB%A5%E2%80%9C%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3%E2%80%9D%E4%B8%BA%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%86%E5%AE%83%E9%87%8D%E5%91%BD%E5%90%8D%E4%B8%BA%E2%80%9CDocuments%E2%80%9D%5Cnmv%20~%2F%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3%20~%2FDocuments%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22id%22%3A%22NIksd%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card>",
